# Mahjong Tiles — Chinese Set, Everything but Characters
# answer-mode: type
# answer-case: insensitive

# Winds, dragons, dots, bamboos, plus the eight flower and season tiles the
# Japanese game leaves out. Each question shows the tile, plays its Mandarin
# reading, and displays the simplified hanzi with pinyin. Type the English
# name of the tile.

